      "TEXT": "SquireSpawn ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans_Day 1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Axe Thrower \n\u0022We have entered a war zone. The Empire\u0027s departure from this realm has created a power vacuum. The remaining humans have launched a revolution. The Orcs sense that now is a time to slaughter all that live!\u0022 \n \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Axe Thrower \n\u0022Thank Wotan! That we have found a magical source that will anchor our capital. Our weak and wounded will benefit from a healing spell as they approach the capital.\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans_Day4 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Axe Thrower \n\u0022This battle will only get worse. We have sent for reinforcements. Every five days a new Mage Lord will arrive to aid us in our Quest to conquer the region.\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Clans_Day 9 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Axe Thrower \n\u0022Fear not, we will survive and dominate the realm yet. As the Maje Lords arrive they have sent word for more reinforcements. Every ten days a Warrior Lord will join us in our battle! The riches of this land will be ours yet!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203UN0037",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Virgile",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves_Day 1 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bandit \n\u0022We are in a war! The Empire have left this realm to focus on other regions. Numerous Elves have already been slaughtered we will honor thier memory by conquering the realm ourselves! The remaining humans have launched an offensive!\u0022 \n \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bandit \n\u0022The Orcs are as dangerous as always. Numerous Orcs have been seen making their way here. Our capital is built upon magical grounds. Bring our weak to the capital and they will be healed instantly.\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves Day 4",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bandit \n\u0022This battle will continue to escalate. I have called in for the Maje Lords to assist us. On every fifth day a Maje Lord will arrive to help us in our Quest. This realm will fall to the Alliance!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Elves_day9",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bandit \n\u0022Do not be worried! I have called in for yet more help! This war has escalated greater than I thought! Every ten days a Warrior Lord will join us. In time we should have a formidable army to command. This realm will be ours yet!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City_Margylla ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The Alliance will be crushed under the heels of my boot. The Elves do not have the right to be in this realm. We will chase them off like dogs!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203UN003b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Godefroy",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City_Perchon ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The Mountain Clans have been a thorn for long enough! This war will only have one victor and it shall be the Alliance\u0027s flag that is raised high!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Vusi ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022This is a great and important victory for us. We must be able to hold onto the five cities.\u0022 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City_Onia ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022This city must not fall to our enemies. Be sure to know that this war has just escalated.\u0022 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Pala ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The Orcs and Humans are going to become more desperate. That is what will make them dangerous! We must be prepared!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City Regal",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Be sure to be on the look out for anything that can help us tip the scales in this battle.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "City  Amu",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We must fight and never give up. Our enemies have called in for reinforcments. We must fight and never give them a moment\u0027s rest!\u0022 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "New Event",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203EV001f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orcs and Human Spawn ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S203UN0042",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Titan",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S203SC0000",
